Ractor support (inspired by https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=41487714)

- [x] Audit native and Ruby global state
- [x] Isolate mutable settings and cleanup queues per Ractor
- [x] Freeze shared Ruby strings
- [x] Enable CURLOPT_NOSIGNAL by default
- [x] Guard rb_ext_ractor_safe(true) on Ruby and thread-safe libcurl support
- [x] Add concurrent Ractor regression coverage
